<title>RUSSIA: Russia to pay 30.97 pct on OFZ bonds' coupon.</title>
<headline>Russia to pay 30.97 pct on OFZ bonds' coupon.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will pay 77,213 roubles or 30.97 percent annual on the sixth coupon when its fifth issue of OFZ bonds mature on July 9, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The fifth OFZ (Federal Borrowing Bonds) coupon of 83,097 roubles or 33.33 percent annual will be paid on April 9.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
